[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ZEF-TEST-021
TITLE: Topic subscription snapshot and publication order
STATEMENT: >>>
Subscribe multiple Reactors, publish one shared dynamic Message,
verify delivery count, descending-identity handling, and claim reclamation
after all recipients process the Message. Duplicate subscription is checked for
idempotence, and publication to a topic with no subscribers verifies immediate
zero-recipient reclamation.
<<<
