[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Clock, timers, and Port boundary

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ZEF-TEST-030
TITLE: One-shot and periodic timer delivery
STATEMENT: >>>
Arm a zero-delay one-shot Timer and a periodic Timer, advance the
Clock, verify enqueue-only expiration, verify periodic due ticks, and verify
stopping an already disarmed Timer returns the documented observation.
<<<
