[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ZEF-TEST-031
TITLE: Timer-specific cancellation
STATEMENT: >>>
Queue an ordinary delivery and a Timer delivery using the same
static Message reference, cancel the Timer, and verify only the Timer-owned
entry is removed.
<<<
