[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ZEF-TEST-032
TITLE: Port critical-section and reschedule callbacks
STATEMENT: >>>
Exercise the host Port fixture's nested critical-state restoration,
reschedule notification from runnable Mailbox changes, and topic operations
through the public Port callback structure. The fixture records entry and leave
counts, verifies nested state restoration, and observes reschedule requests
from startup, subscription changes, and queued work. A second kernel with all
Port callbacks null verifies the optional callback paths remain usable.
<<<
